                            "steamid": "76561198074317322",
                            "num_reviews": 16,
                            "playtime_forever": 233,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 100,
                            "playtime_at_review": 233,
                            "last_played": 1793471054
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Love it!  There is some clipping and there is some jank but don't let that keep you away from this game, I'd highly recommend it to anyone who loves amusement parks.  This is basically the inverse of Disneyland with spectacular design and some extremely inventive rides mixed in.  The art style and graphical package is truly impressive and rivals most AAA game out there.  I spent way to long just taking it slow and admiring all the details packed into this short but sweet game.  Get it!  It will make for a great little creepy Halloween game since we are in the season after all.",
